--
Regression test for the to_member fix in symex dereference_rec.

Exercises [dcl.init.ref]/5 and [expr.eq]/3 in the specific pattern
!(&x::f != 0) where the simplifier converts to &x::f == 0 and symex
must preserve the pointer-to-member attribute on the address_of
operand.  Without the fix in be467fbd92 this test fails the
binary_relation_exprt::validate invariant because the two operands
have pointer types that disagree on the to_member attribute.
